    "title": "PDF Reader Pro- All PDF Viewer",
    "description": "Easily read and manage PDF files and all office documents with PDF Reader & Viewer app, PDF, Word, Excel and PPT documents for Android.\r\n\r\nIntroducing our advanced and practical PDF Reader & Viewer app, a versatile and user-friendly tool that redefines the way you interact with PDF documents and all office files. Whether you're a professional managing important reports or a student reviewing lecture notes, our PDF Reader & Viewer app is designed to enhance your document viewing experience with powerful features and an intuitive interface.\r\n\r\nUse this free Android PDF Reader & Viewer app to read and view all PDF files and all office documents on your phone anytime, anywhere, even when there is no Internet connection. PDF Reader & Viewer app will automatically search and display all files on your system, enabling you to quickly open and read PDFs and all office files on your device. With fast opening, efficient reading, easy search, image to pdf converter, multiple browsing modes, zoom in and out browsing, printing documents, and document sharing, PDF Reader & Viewer app is definitely the best choice for your office efficiency!\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n\r\nSupports all office document types, PDF, Word, Excel and PPT documents, quickly open document files in one place.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 PDF reading and viewing\r\n- Clear and easy-to-use PDF documents list: Simple interface for quick document browsing.\r\n- Vertical and horizontal viewing PDF files: Customize your viewing mode for optimal reading.\r\n- Zoom in and out PDF document pages: Easily adjust zoom for detailed or overview viewing.\r\n- Enter PDF document page number to jump quickly: Instantly navigate to any page by entering the page number.\r\n- Drag and drag to browse PDF pages continuously: Smooth scrolling for seamless page browsing.\r\n- Full screen immersive reading PDF experience: Full-screen mode for distraction-free reading.\r\n- PDF reader Light mode / Dark mode: Protect your eyes with adjustable light/dark modes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 PDF document management\r\n- All PDF documents and all office files in one place: Unified management for all your files.\r\n- List of recently opened PDF documents: Quick access to recently viewed documents.\r\n- Easily search PDF documents: Powerful search for fast document retrieval.\r\n- Convert Photo to PDF: PDF converter, Merge images and create PDFs for easy sharing.\r\n- Multiple ways to sort PDF files: Offers sorting options like file name, modification time for easy management.\r\n- Share PDF documents with others easily: Supports sharing via email, social media, etc.\r\n- PDF Files rename: Rename PDF files to suit your naming preferences or content.\r\n- Collect important PDF documents: Favorite important PDFs for quick access and reading.\r\n- PDF files printing: Supports direct printing of PDF files.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 More features of PDF Reader & Viewer app\r\n-Universal reading: Supports all document types, including PDF, Word, Excel and PPT files, and can open documents from any source - internal storage, email, cloud storage or network, etc.\r\n-PDF book reading: Use PDF Reader to open and enjoy PDF books anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Default PDF Reader: Set PDF Reader as default, you don't need to open the app separately, you can preview and read PDF directly in the file manager, email or cloud.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your PDF reading experience with our feature-rich and user-friendly PDF Reader & Viewer app. Download now and discover new levels of efficiency and convenience when working with digital documents.\r\n\r\nMore exciting product features are being continuously updated. We are committed to enhancing your experience. If you have any suggestions or questions, please contact us: maihomesup@outlook.com.\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://adeh.allmailhome.com/privacy-policy/\r\nUser Agreement: https://adeh.allmailhome.com/terms-of-service/",
